Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y): picked as the prerequisite of https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8430557, which relies on the MaybeDeactivatePicker() helper and the mutual-exclusion callback resets introduced here. This branch has no screenshot capture in NativeScreenCapturePickerMac (CaptureScreenshot/CaptureScreenshotInternal/EphemeralFrameGrabber do not exist), so the screenshot-related parts (OnScreenshotCaptured, the CaptureScreenshotInternal changes, CaptureScreenshotFromMacNativePicker and the three CaptureScreenshot* unit tests) are not carried; MaybeDeactivatePicker(), the callback resets in OnPickerObserverUpdated/Cancelled/EncounteredError, the Close() change and the CancelPickerDeactivatesSystemPicker test apply as upstream.

